{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>MINAMI特製奶油火雞麵燉飯 </h2>\n<p>韓國人氣女團RESENCE成員 MINAMI 在Twice成員Sana的YouTube節目中公開大推的「辣火雞麵燉飯」食譜，將濃郁奶香與辛辣火雞麵醬完美結合，成為近期爆紅的罪惡美食。\n</p>\n<h2>製作步驟簡單</h2>\n<p>這款食譜只需準備奶油白醬火雞麵、白飯半碗、冰牛奶150ml- 200ml及披薩起司，嗜辣者可額外添加火雞麵辣醬。 製作步驟簡單：先將火雞麵取出放入可微波容器並將麵體敲碎，加入白飯、醬料包及牛奶拌勻，再鋪上芝士。蓋上蓋子（留一點縫隙透氣），放入微波爐加熱4分鐘即可完成，拿出來攪拌均勻即可。 完成的燉飯奶香、芝士香與辣味交織，醬汁掛滿每條麵條，濃郁又帶點辣。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179284322225238698_20935257246adc9dd6dbc9f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179284322225238698_20935257246adc9dd6dbc9f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179284322432987921_9111229596adc9dd89ce9a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179284322432987921_9111229596adc9dd89ce9a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179284322618940572_4367985726adc9dda8532d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179284322618940572_4367985726adc9dda8532d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/De30Ea0E-Cl/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:09.451583+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":388,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:00:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:38:22.838817+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:31.088115+00:00","content_hash":"b8ead316746c1ff8b8110e5f16b5b8865588ce0dffbae6c5e69acdfae8c8c6cf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}